ow><row r="2" ht="169.75" customHeight="1"><c r="A2" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-001</t></is></c><c r="B2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Add and publish a product with all valid data</t></is></c><c r="D2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Use Case Testing</t></is></c><c r="E2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Fill in every field with the test data and upload 2 images.
2. Click Publish.
3. Refresh the product list.
4. As Buyer 1, search for the name, open the platform category and the store page.</t></is></c><c r="H2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Name: Buri Placemat Set
Description: Set of 6 placemats, handwoven buri palm.
Images: product_front.jpg, product_side.png
Platform category: Home &amp; Living
Store category: Kitchen &amp; Dining
Brand: No brand
Condition: New
Price: &#8369;299.00
Stock: 30
Weight: 0.6 kg
Size: 35 &#215; 25 &#215; 3 cm</t></is></c><c r="I2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The product is saved as Active with exactly these values. Buyers find it in search, in Home &amp; Living and in the store's Kitchen &amp; Dining, showing &#8369;299.00 and 30 in stock. Images appear in the uploaded order.</t></is></c><c r="J2" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A16, A17, A25</t></is></c><c r="K2" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L2" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M2" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="3" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A3" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-002</t></is></c><c r="B3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Each required field left blank</t></is></c><c r="D3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Equivalence Partitioning</t></is></c><c r="E3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Fill in all fields with valid data.
2. Clear one required field and click Publish.
3. Repeat for each field in the test data.</t></is></c><c r="H3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Clear in turn: Name, Description, Images, Platform category, Price, Stock, Weight</t></is></c><c r="I3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Each attempt is blocked and a required-field message is shown on that field only. The other entered values (including uploaded images) are kept on the form. No product is created.</t></is></c><c r="J3" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="K3" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L3" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M3" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="4" ht="106" customHeight="1"><c r="A4" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-003</t></is></c><c r="B4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product name and description length</t></is></c><c r="D4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Enter each value, one per attempt, with all other fields valid.
2. Click Publish.</t></is></c><c r="H4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Name 4 characters: Tote (reject)
Name 5: Totes (accept)
Name 120 (accept)
Name 121 (reject)
Description 19 characters (reject)
Description 20 (accept)
Description 3,000 (accept)
Description 3,001 (reject)</t></is></c><c r="I4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Only the 'accept' values publish. Each 'reject' value shows a message with the exact limit.</t></is></c><c r="J4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A25</t></is></c><c r="K4" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L4" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M4" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="5" ht="144.25" customHeight="1"><c r="A5" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-004</t></is></c><c r="B5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Price validation</t></is></c><c r="D5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Enter each price, one per attempt, with all other fields valid.
2. Click Publish.</t></is></c><c r="H5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>0 (reject)
-50 (reject)
0.99 (reject)
1.00 (accept)
1.01 (accept)
199.999 (reject: 3 decimals)
999,999.99 (accept)
1,000,000.00 (accept)
1,000,000.01 (reject)
abc (reject)
Empty (reject)</t></is></c><c r="I5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Only 1.00, 1.01, 999,999.99 and 1,000,000.00 are accepted and saved exactly. Every other value is rejected with a price message and nothing is created. 199.999 is never rounded silently to 200.00.</t></is></c><c r="J5" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A17</t></is></c><c r="K5" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L5" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M5" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="6" ht="80.5" customHeight="1"><c r="A6" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-005</t></is></c><c r="B6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Stock validation</t></is></c><c r="D6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Enter each stock value, one per attempt.
2. Click Publish.</t></is></c><c r="H6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>-1 (reject)
0 (accept, product shows Sold out)
1 (accept)
99,999 (accept)
100,000 (reject)
2.5 (reject)</t></is></c><c r="I6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Only whole numbers 0 to 99,999 are accepted. A product published with 0 stock shows Sold out to buyers.</t></is></c><c r="J6" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A17</t></is></c><c r="K6" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L6" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M6" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="7" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A7" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-006</t></is></c><c r="B7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Image count at the limits</t></is></c><c r="D7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Try to publish with 0 images.
2. Publish with 1 image.
3. Edit and add up to 9 images.
4. Try to add a 10th image.</t></is></c><c r="H7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>0 (reject), 1 (accept), 9 (accept), 10 (reject)</t></is></c><c r="I7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>0 images is blocked with a message. 1 and 9 images are saved. The 10th image cannot be added (the upload button is disabled or a limit message appears).</t></is></c><c r="J7" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A16</t></is></c><c r="K7" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L7" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M7" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="8" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A8" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-007</t></is></c><c r="B8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Image file type and size</t></is></c><c r="D8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Upload each file as a product image, one at a time.</t></is></c><c r="H8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>size_5.0MB.jpg (accept)
size_5.1MB.jpg (reject)
price_list.docx (reject)
renamed_exe.jpg (reject)</t></is></c><c r="I8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Only the 5.0 MB JPG is accepted. The others are rejected with a message naming JPG/PNG and 5 MB, and are not added to the image list.</t></is></c><c r="J8" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A16</t></is></c><c r="K8" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L8" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M8" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="9" ht="67.75" customHeight="1"><c r="A9" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-008</t></is></c><c r="B9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Weight and dimensions validation</t></is></c><c r="D9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Boundary Value Analysis</t></is></c><c r="E9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Enter each value, one per attempt, and click Publish.</t></is></c><c r="H9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Weight 0 (reject)
Weight -1 (reject)
Weight 0.01 kg (accept)
Dimensions 0 &#215; 0 &#215; 0 (reject)
Dimensions abc (reject)</t></is></c><c r="I9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Zero, negative and non-numeric values are rejected with a message. 0.01 kg is saved and later charged as 1 kg at checkout.</t></is></c><c r="J9" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A20</t></is></c><c r="K9" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L9" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M9" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="10" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A10" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-009</t></is></c><c r="B10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Save as draft</t></is></c><c r="D10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Add Product page is open.</t></is></c><c r="G10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Fill in the name only.
2. Click Save as Draft.
3. As Buyer 1, search for the name and open the product's URL directly.</t></is></c><c r="H10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Name: Draft Woven Fan</t></is></c><c r="I10" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The draft is saved with status Draft and no validation errors for other fields. It never appears to buyers, and its URL shows 'not found' or 'unavailable'.</t></is></c><c r="J10" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="K10" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L10" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M10" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="11" ht="42.25" customHeight="1"><c r="A11" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-010</t></is></c><c r="B11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Publish a draft with missing data</t></is></c><c r="D11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). The draft from the previous case exists.</t></is></c><c r="G11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Open the draft and click Publish without filling the other fields.</t></is></c><c r="H11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Draft Woven Fan</t></is></c><c r="I11" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Publishing is blocked with required-field messages. The product stays Draft.</t></is></c><c r="J11" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="K11" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L11" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M11" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="12" ht="80.5" customHeight="1"><c r="A12" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-011</t></is></c><c r="B12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Deactivate and reactivate a product</t></is></c><c r="D12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). P-02 is Active. Buyer 1 has P-02 in the cart.</t></is></c><c r="G12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Deactivate P-02.
2. As Buyer 1, search for it, open its URL and open the cart.
3. Reactivate P-02 and repeat the checks.</t></is></c><c r="H12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>P-02 Rattan Fruit Basket</t></is></c><c r="I12" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>While inactive: P-02 is missing from search, category and store pages; its URL shows 'unavailable'; the cart line is marked unavailable and cannot be checked out. After reactivation everything returns with the same price, stock and images.</t></is></c><c r="J12" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="K12" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L12" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M12" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="13" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A13" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-012</t></is></c><c r="B13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Duplicate a product</t></is></c><c r="D13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Use Case Testing</t></is></c><c r="E13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Low</t></is></c><c r="F13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved).</t></is></c><c r="G13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Click Duplicate on P-02.
2. Check the copy's fields and save it.</t></is></c><c r="H13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>P-02</t></is></c><c r="I13" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The copy has the same details, a new product ID, and is saved as Draft. The original P-02 is unchanged and buyers see only one Rattan Fruit Basket.</t></is></c><c r="J13" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="K13" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L13" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M13" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="14" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A14" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-013</t></is></c><c r="B14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Edit price of a product in a buyer's cart</t></is></c><c r="D14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). Buyer 1 has P-02 (&#8369;450.00) in the cart.</t></is></c><c r="G14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Change P-02's price to &#8369;420.00 and save.
2. As Buyer 1, refresh the cart and go to checkout.</t></is></c><c r="H14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>&#8369;450.00 &#8594; &#8369;420.00</t></is></c><c r="I14" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>The cart line and checkout both show &#8369;420.00 and the subtotal is recalculated. The old price is not used anywhere.</t></is></c><c r="J14" s="8" t="inlineStr"></c><c r="K14" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L14" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M14" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="15" ht="42.25" customHeight="1"><c r="A15" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-014</t></is></c><c r="B15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Delete a product with unfinished orders</t></is></c><c r="D15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>High</t></is></c><c r="F15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). P-02 is in an order with status To Ship.</t></is></c><c r="G15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Click Delete on P-02 and confirm.</t></is></c><c r="H15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>P-02</t></is></c><c r="I15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Deletion is blocked with a message that the product has unfinished orders. P-02 stays Active.</t></is></c><c r="J15" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A19</t></is></c><c r="K15" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L15" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M15" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="16" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A16" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-PROD-015</t></is></c><c r="B16" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Product Management</t></is></c><c r="C16" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Delete a product with only finished orders</t></is></c><c r="D16" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E16" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F16" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). P-04 has only Completed orders.</t></is></c><c r="G16" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Delete P-04 and confirm.
